# DiagnosticsBridge.h is a real build dependency (included by kernel/calls.c for
# both the CLI and app builds), not generated diagnostics output. The pattern
# above matches it case-insensitively on macOS, so a fresh checkout silently
# lacked it and the build broke. Keep it tracked.
!app/DiagnosticsBridge.h

